      "message": "test(app): contour5d pick pins sample each level cut against the automatic ladder\n\nThe rings pin read only the first and the last point of a run. Each level\ncut of a seated ring is now sampled every 0.25 mm and must ride the\nautomatic ladder within the operation tolerance. The #3330 pins move to\nstart_exit_shared/contour5d.rs.\n\nRefs #3330\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
